-- Spec EMIT-5: a chain of guards loads and runs at any length, whatever
-- its conditions and arms need: plain conditions, conditions and arms with
-- statements of their own, the guards of a tail-recursive function, and
-- guards that read a value bound before them, arms that own their value or
-- throw, a loop arm that may either leave the loop or go round again, and
-- 22 chains each nested in an arm of the one before.
module main (plain, stmts, countdown, shared, named, nested)

import root-rust

